    },
    {
      "card_ids": ["C02"],
      "claim": "Ketoprofen, an arylpropionic acid with a bulky benzoyl substituent, has absolute oral bioavailability of 84.5% in healthy subjects, supporting high F for a similar carboxylic acid bearing large aromatic groups.",
