  "confidence": "moderate",
  "decision_summary": "All transferable experimental evidence points to high oral bioavailability: close structural analogues with carboxylic acids and bulky aromatic/lipophilic substituents show absolute F values of 47-100%, and no affirmative evidence supports F < 20%. Therefore predict high.",
